    HENCE FULFILLED
    LEST BREACH BY `s 123 an authority granting housing benefit` BECAUSE "copies of the housing benefit scheme, with any modifications adopted under the Administration Act, were not made available for public inspection at the authority's principal office at all reasonable hours without payment"

-- src:2646 | (3) Every authority granting housing benefit—
