GIVEN `the authority grants housing benefit` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the place is the authority's principal office` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the hour is a reasonable hour` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 123(3)(b) the person may inspect a copy of the housing benefit scheme without payment` MEANS
    IF `the authority grants housing benefit` AND `the place is the authority's principal office` AND `the hour is a reasonable hour`
    THEN JUST TRUE
    ELSE NOTHING   -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): "at their principal office at all reasonable hours"

